; Triangular_72Pair_0p5to1mm_6Speeds_2Widths_Flow1p4_K0p55
; P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG; TRIANGULAR geometry, two mirrored paths per object
; 72 individually completed pairs: six sizes 0.5-1.0 mm x six upper speeds x two nominal widths
; Upper speeds 5, 7.5, 10, 15, 20, 25 mm/s at EACH width: 0.162876 and 0.15 mm
; EVERY first layer is 5 mm/s; 10 layers per pair, 0.06 mm layers, total height 0.60 mm
; Flow ratio 1.4 throughout, included in E; M221 remains 100 percent
; Nozzle 255 C; bed 70 C; M900 K0.55 L1000 M10; XY purge line 20 mm/s
; PCF off layers 1-3, then layer-time fan 40-90 percent using 30/12 second thresholds
; Auxiliary fan off during model; first/upper acceleration 500/2000 mm/s^2
; 10 mm straight intro/outro; 0.4 mm retract over 2 mm wipe, then lift to Z1
; Original triangle shapes and latest matrix mirror spacing retained; no square waves
; Four physical rows, 18 pairs per row; complete all 10 layers before the next object
; Left-to-right printing, then next row front-to-back; object IDs in SVG/CSV key
; Nominal width with flow 1.4 does not guarantee measured physical bead width
; Static checks only; physical print verification required
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
